Hybrid-UniSE Research Engineering Repository

This repository is an independent, substantially modified research codebase
derived from the Apache-2.0-licensed Alibaba unified-audio / QuarkAudio-UniSE
project:

  https://github.com/alibaba/unified-audio/tree/main/QuarkAudio-UniSE

It retains upstream UniSE/BiCodec source code and selected upstream demo assets,
and adds a paper-inspired Hybrid-UniSE implementation, data paths,
configuration, diagnostics, experiment contracts, documentation, and tests.

The repository is not affiliated with Alibaba and is not an official
implementation of either the UniSE or Hybrid-UniSE papers.

Files under assets/upstream/ were inherited from the upstream source tree.
They are retained only as reference material and must not be presented as
outputs of this Hybrid-UniSE project.

External model weights and datasets are not included and remain subject to
their own licenses and terms.
